  message: "mulul run 2026-10-03, branch jgstern-agent/fix/mulul-catalogue-rows (local only), commit 649000cd32. getHomeDirectory / getTemporaryDirectory (+ community System.Directory.Extra twins) moved fs_read -> host_info_read -- NOT the env_read this item's root_cause proposed. INV-tutar puts host description / user identity in host_info_read, and every other catalogue rows home and temp dir there, several reading HOME/TMPDIR the same way (python Path.home / os.path.expanduser / tempfile.gettempdir, go os.UserHomeDir, rust home_dir / temp_dir, js os.homedir / os.tmpdir, elixir System.user_home / tmp_dir, scala Properties.userHome / tmpDir); env_read would mint host_secret for a home directory. Repro (haskell fixture printing all four directory reads): \"never reads the filesystem\" violated -> CONFIRMED; host-description-no-logging confirmed -> violated; host-secret-no-logging not violated (pinned). Unrowed siblings (getXdgDirectory etc.) in WI-vaduf-mamav-savit-vokod-jojun-fibur-gilab-tagis. Report: decontend/run_10032026/mulul.md."  # c636
